 Bait card back into the deck at a position of your choosing (top, 2nd, 3rd, bottom).<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2001860/extras/c6156c6d8b20ab0cbaceb69212ef9979.avif?t=1766718076\" width=780 height=180 /></span>On your turn, you may play <strong>as many action cards as you want</strong>, in any order. Some examples are:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Alter</strong> \u2013 Rearrange the top three cards of the deck.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Favor</strong> \u2013 Force another player to give you a card of their choice.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skip</strong> \u2013 Skip your turn</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Attack</strong> \u2013 Next player must draw 2 cards to end their turn\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nope</strong> \u2013 Cancel the effect of a card.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reverse</strong> \u2013 Change the direction of play.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Use these cards wisely to keep yourself off the dinner menu.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2001860/extras/bf7d910f19b6704bf9c8daa831c3ba87.avif?t=1766718076\" width=780 height=180 /></span><br>Your turn ends when you <strong>draw a card</strong>. This is normally from the top of the deck, but certain actions also count as your draw.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For example, using <strong>Dig</strong> (draw the bottom card of the deck) <i>immediately ends your turn</i>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["